      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>In the name of the Compassionate</li>\n<li><i>&ldquo;Behold, God is my salvation,&rdquo; etc.</i></li>\n<li>The noble community</li>\n<li>in Fustat, <i>may their Rock bless them, a(men) f(orever) </i><i>s(ela),</i> knows that</li>\n<li><i>the duty of charity</i> brings a great reward in His,</li>\n<li>the ex(alted&rsquo;s), pr[esence]. This is especially so when the person <i>is poor and embarrassed and old</i>,</li>\n<li>such as the bearer, Yeshu\u02bfa, <i>(may he have a) g(ood) e(nd).</i></li>\n<li>It is in your beneficent nature to help</li>\n<li>and assist him because he wishes to travel</li>\n<li>to his&nbsp;city, <i>Jerusalem, the Holy City, may it be rebuilt and est(ablished)</i>,</li>\n<li>for his children are waiting for him. Therefore, take up a collection</li>\n<li>for him in the <i>two congregations</i> and open your hands wide</li>\n<li>in giving to him, for this is the time for virtuous generosity. <i>&ldquo;Let not </i></li>\n<li><i>the downtrodden turn away disappointed</i>&rdquo; (Psalm 74:21). May God the ex(alted) be your</li>\n<li>succor, make your habitations prosper, grant long life to your children,</li>\n<li>and increase your sustenance. <i>And peace.</i></li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
